#: maxframe.liteframe.accessors.struct_.accessor.StructAccessor.explode:1 of
msgid "Expand a struct column into one column per field."
msgstr "将结构体列展开为每个字段一列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.accessors.struct_.accessor.StructAccessor.explode:3 of
msgid ""
"Mirrors ``pandas.Series.struct.explode``: the struct column is replaced "
"by one column per field (each with its field dtype); a missing struct "
"becomes one row of all-NA fields.  Row count is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"镜像 ``pandas.Series.struct.explode``：结构体列被替换为每个字段一列（每个"
"都带有其字段数据类型）；缺失的结构体变为一行全为NA的字段。行数保持不变。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.struct.explode.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.accessors.struct_.accessor.StructAccessor.explode:8 of
msgid ""
"LiteFrame with the struct column replaced by one column per field, each "
"carrying its field dtype; row count unchanged."
msgstr ""
"结构体列被替换为每个字段一列的LiteFrame，每个都携带其字段数据类型；行数"
"保持不变。"

